      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The Hidden Socket enchant adds a card slot to certain armors."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "It is done through the Apprentice Craftsman in Prontera."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Required Materials",
      "anchor": "material"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1 armor to enchant"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Effect",
      "anchor": "effect"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Turns a slotless armor into a slotted armor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "It also adds a random +1 ~ +3 to one of STR, AGI, VIT, INT, DEX or LUK."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Eligible equipment, 400,000 Zeny",
      "anchor": "target"
    },
    {
